  "title": "Execute an Entrance Effect at Battle Start [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "戦闘開始時に登場演出を実行【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "8744b87807bb2081ab4c7a6c804d00911ee70051f92920cabd38927048d8d84a",
      "translation": "Execute an Entrance Effect at Battle Start [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "8744b87807bb2081ab4c7a6c804d00911ee70051f92920cabd38927048d8d84a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘開始時にバトラーの登場演出を実行します。",
      "sourceHash": "9b91a5d1c6e523d9ab3aee3c0dfccc4e0f4faae888dcb5f5052f5dea24d8787a",
      "translation": "Executes an entrance effect for battlers at the start of battle.",
      "contextHash": "9b91a5d1c6e523d9ab3aee3c0dfccc4e0f4faae888dcb5f5052f5dea24d8787a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "演出はDynamicAnimation&Motionプラグインによって作成します。",
      "sourceHash": "deea8e6b8fcc70fc7c40727a71507885ce61d7ebdace51aa0a4cc23983da860c",
      "translation": "The effects are created using the DynamicAnimation&Motion plugin.",
      "contextHash": "deea8e6b8fcc70fc7c40727a71507885ce61d7ebdace51aa0a4cc23983da860c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON in the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ただし、ＭＶでは挙動が怪しいです。アクター側の登場演出を設定するとエラーになってしまう模様です。",
      "sourceHash": "6a52b7854744bfc9a2163113df8ed09b559f937d2ec98c2ae2841112e8c262ba",
      "translation": "※However, its behavior in MV is unreliable. Setting an entrance effect for an actor appears to cause an error.",
      "contextHash": "6a52b7854744bfc9a2163113df8ed09b559f937d2ec98c2ae2841112e8c262ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_DynamicAppear.js",
      "sourceHash": "6db16484030c713628a70a32b65b33a2ed89eebfdc7b3a3bcbbb19a849d589dd",
      "translation": "NRP_DynamicAppear.js ",
      "contextHash": "706a0362fa70447bc4a124b4e2089af881c709a987c9523e585124d7c86f13cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ver1.01（2022/12/10）",
      "sourceHash": "4c41b9f41dc9f7d22781ad1baa2ee871a6a1cd77d508953dfb27ad183abdbe21",
      "translation": "ver1.01 (2022/12/10) ",
      "contextHash": "706a0362fa70447bc4a124b4e2089af881c709a987c9523e585124d7c86f13cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "動作には、さらに以下のプラグインが必須となります。",
      "sourceHash": "60b7e6080d05c7a5b6b538c104278f91acbd1feb1e76f5c4440a15e4a241667f",
      "translation": "The following additional plugins are also required for this plugin to work.",
      "contextHash": "60b7e6080d05c7a5b6b538c104278f91acbd1feb1e76f5c4440a15e4a241667f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＭＺ版",
      "sourceHash": "f4e12ec1f262af102a6e78afd980be32c1cf3dc99bc801df41f42e942c3093f1",
      "translation": "MZ Version",
      "contextHash": "f4e12ec1f262af102a6e78afd980be32c1cf3dc99bc801df41f42e942c3093f1"
    },
    {
