      "sourceHash": "941cc4be91979678473712609fd10f5550941c370ac71bbf9f8464c7f48e0c25",
      "translation": "MV Version",
      "contextHash": "941cc4be91979678473712609fd10f5550941c370ac71bbf9f8464c7f48e0c25"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2022/12/10（ver1.01）",
      "sourceHash": "2ae5f71e522d90d9a8432f7c73ee862b2a6eee6a9de55bf9837beaa7b6d45bb2",
      "translation": "2022/12/10 (ver1.01) ",
      "contextHash": "2ae5f71e522d90d9a8432f7c73ee862b2a6eee6a9de55bf9837beaa7b6d45bb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "戦闘開始直後に逃げると移動演出がなくなる不具合を修正。",
      "sourceHash": "c09e7b6cd76281bc9006acc29b07305075720fb890ae220f377d428cd9db8743",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug where the movement effect disappeared when escaping immediately after battle started.",
      "contextHash": "c09e7b6cd76281bc9006acc29b07305075720fb890ae220f377d428cd9db8743"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2022/03/11 -> 2022/04/21（ver1.00）",
      "sourceHash": "cf0970f2d45ee244a5ae3037e8531364989aae74c9f45bbaca725476720a2a5c",
      "translation": "2022/03/11 -> 2022/04/21 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "cf0970f2d45ee244a5ae3037e8531364989aae74c9f45bbaca725476720a2a5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "DynamicAnimation&Motionプラグインの説明に従って、演出用のスキルを作成してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0a847dfa81406eb38654b673c821140cc0991b6bd4912018f13d59d648bfe276",
      "translation": "Following the instructions for the DynamicAnimation&Motion plugin, create a skill for the effect.",
      "contextHash": "0a847dfa81406eb38654b673c821140cc0991b6bd4912018f13d59d648bfe276"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※必要なのはメモ欄の定義だけなので、その他の設定は不問です。",
      "sourceHash": "f89adb6df9d558faf6d5d8f92c10b679622307183d4811f0e7e93582b71d2451",
      "translation": "※Only the note field definition is required, so the other settings do not matter.",
      "contextHash": "f89adb6df9d558faf6d5d8f92c10b679622307183d4811f0e7e93582b71d2451"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "後はアクター（または職業）、敵キャラのメモ欄に以下の通り、スキルＩＤを設定すればＯＫです。",
      "sourceHash": "b7a4953124913e7a44fe9d4536bff4cf1259a85edac0a41c8530e418c21c173b",
      "translation": "Then, simply set the skill ID in the note field of the actor (or class) and enemy as follows.",
      "contextHash": "b7a4953124913e7a44fe9d4536bff4cf1259a85edac0a41c8530e418c21c173b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "個別の指定がない場合は、プラグインパラメータの初期値が使用されます。",
      "sourceHash": "3854af684423b28096dc326bb58ff23b891967c7969b2b93c00614bbe9f1ebe1",
      "translation": "If no individual setting is specified, the default plugin parameter value is used.",
      "contextHash": "3854af684423b28096dc326bb58ff23b891967c7969b2b93c00614bbe9f1ebe1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "アクター、敵キャラ、職業のメモ欄（Note）",
      "sourceHash": "d5fc7fb5ba0f101b6602f54d5d38d6ea154f39d5d141849e9aec1d0c0a27ee36",
      "translation": "Actor, Enemy, and Class Note Fields (Note)",
      "contextHash": "d5fc7fb5ba0f101b6602f54d5d38d6ea154f39d5d141849e9aec1d0c0a27ee36"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "DynamicAnimation&Motionプラグインと連携し、x番のスキルに指定された演出で登場します。",
      "sourceHash": "b0aef1247a935f43d2b3fbb2a2f75fe9a541af7e81adc6c6bed309380c44ef62",
      "translation": "In coordination with the DynamicAnimation&Motion plugin, the battler enters with the effect specified for skill x.",
      "contextHash": "b0aef1247a935f43d2b3fbb2a2f75fe9a541af7e81adc6c6bed309380c44ef62"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、職業のメモ欄に設定した場合は、アクターの設定よりも優先されます。",
      "sourceHash": "67e4b2a6ba203868587359c12905b41d67e30162c04712ac21a0a8aaa38c6f6c",
      "translation": "When set in a class's note field, it takes priority over the actor's setting.",
      "contextHash": "67e4b2a6ba203868587359c12905b41d67e30162c04712ac21a0a8aaa38c6f6c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "DynamicMotionによる演出の例（Sample of DynamicMotion）",
      "sourceHash": "b7865d2dc9ac568b893fd183118c4bc38c4aa20d27c9d7a086f84426e6c0e4cf",
      "translation": "Examples of Effects Using DynamicMotion (Sample of DynamicMotion)",
      "contextHash": "b7865d2dc9ac568b893fd183118c4bc38c4aa20d27c9d7a086f84426e6c0e4cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "画面外から登場",
      "sourceHash": "8e1f15934f5753dadf9fa550e80ef9258d3bd891b895b4da2db87981b697e2e3",
      "translation": "Enter from Off-Screen",
      "contextHash": "8e1f15934f5753dadf9fa550e80ef9258d3bd891b895b4da2db87981b697e2e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オーソドックスに画面外から登場します。",
      "sourceHash": "6ffdcd109e2664e5ff848ec4a5ba29ed7ddd544ca2fd5aa59300c06ce47f1172",
      "translation": "The battler enters from off-screen in a classic fashion.",
      "contextHash": "6ffdcd109e2664e5ff848ec4a5ba29ed7ddd544ca2fd5aa59300c06ce47f1172"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 戦闘開始時に時間差",
      "sourceHash": "dea716aa371ee8d9be4ee4ced088c89d09eb9642855f70964d44422c3c7acc17",
      "translation": "// Time delay at battle start",
      "contextHash": "dea716aa371ee8d9be4ee4ced088c89d09eb9642855f70964d44422c3c7acc17"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "wait = a.index() * 3 // 時間差",
      "sourceHash": "2b79c8400ed9dcda10a2b3de56dea31c98feede85940c66d0822c1e1c4f9fd7e",
      "translation": "wait = a.index() * 3 // Time delay",
      "contextHash": "2b79c8400ed9dcda10a2b3de56dea31c98feede85940c66d0822c1e1c4f9fd7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-003",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "frame = 5 // 移動時間",
      "sourceHash": "a486c8795d44600f25d6092fad62f4784ae7c3014c2d1707e97a34fdac508819",
      "translation": "frame = 5 // Movement time",
      "contextHash": "a486c8795d44600f25d6092fad62f4784ae7c3014c2d1707e97a34fdac508819"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-004",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sx = a._homeX + 500 * mirroring // 始点Ｘ座標（画面外）",
      "sourceHash": "308c4e8b61c6724b1c6d847daa9665f849adf09f65214e7b605bee51afb6f590",
      "translation": "sx = a._homeX + 500 * mirroring // Starting X coordinate (off-screen)",
      "contextHash": "308c4e8b61c6724b1c6d847daa9665f849adf09f65214e7b605bee51afb6f590"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-005",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sy = a._homeY // 始点Ｙ座標",
      "sourceHash": "117143737c5b2d941dfe468b1a0d03105404acd938d0097e0387fbd335a35b56",
      "translation": "sy = a._homeY // Starting Y coordinate",
      "contextHash": "117143737c5b2d941dfe468b1a0d03105404acd938d0097e0387fbd335a35b56"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-006",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ex = a._homeX // 終点Ｘ座標",
      "sourceHash": "e747cf0dc45528854b11206e934881d0de106d6c54271e9ef74b06b60fbc0585",
      "translation": "ex = a._homeX // Ending X coordinate",
      "contextHash": "e747cf0dc45528854b11206e934881d0de106d6c54271e9ef74b06b60fbc0585"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-007",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ey = a._homeY // 終点Ｙ座標",
      "sourceHash": "d8367a3f908a7eaab930b539101c856c6fb8dcf55757ff0e1f329b397d9b759f",
      "translation": "ey = a._homeY // Ending Y coordinate",
      "contextHash": "d8367a3f908a7eaab930b539101c856c6fb8dcf55757ff0e1f329b397d9b759f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『a』で登場するバトラーを参照できます。",
      "sourceHash": "3bdd735338971b9d311b2aed862a36539a8af7bd221f3bc56683783c9a0e0f57",
      "translation": "You can reference the battler entering with 『a』.",
      "contextHash": "3bdd735338971b9d311b2aed862a36539a8af7bd221f3bc56683783c9a0e0f57"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『a._homeX』『a._homeY』が配置地点となるので、最終的にそこへ移動するように実装してください。",
      "sourceHash": "f694b4b3d26cb51f2e62eee988f00e37c68a5258e91eecaf0607a5bb6a0b4e9b",
      "translation": " \"a._homeX』 and 『a._homeY』 are the placement coordinates, so implement the movement so that the battler ultimately moves there.",
      "contextHash": "f694b4b3d26cb51f2e62eee988f00e37c68a5258e91eecaf0607a5bb6a0b4e9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "赤字部分によって、登場時の時間差を表現しています。",
      "sourceHash": "d54316d85cac9b6702500ad4e19307791ab62fae8632616ebcc70331876728a5",
      "translation": "The red portions represent the time offset when entering.",
      "contextHash": "d54316d85cac9b6702500ad4e19307791ab62fae8632616ebcc70331876728a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※この機能（condition）はDynamicAnimation&Motionを最新化（2022/03/10～）していないとうまく動作しないので、ご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "c49f57167c1566bf7d04f75aa28e1ff6c43ddb96f8b3fa851e39d66579bd3e17",
      "translation": "※Please note that this feature (condition) will not work properly unless DynamicAnimation&Motion has been updated to the latest version (2022/03/10 onward).",
      "contextHash": "c49f57167c1566bf7d04f75aa28e1ff6c43ddb96f8b3fa851e39d66579bd3e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "上空から登場（2023/03/09更新）",
      "sourceHash": "0675f65357489d9a52778f0c19032c5d3b2ab3de3c82dce7fdc9dc98391c1aaa",
      "translation": "Enter from Above (Updated 2023/03/09)",
      "contextHash": "0675f65357489d9a52778f0c19032c5d3b2ab3de3c82dce7fdc9dc98391c1aaa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上空から登場します。飛行系の魔物などに最適です。",
      "sourceHash": "e97a33632985367ab244d9198132ec108afbd318b2038dd1ae72b1ae4d00131a",
      "translation": "The battler enters from above. This is ideal for flying monsters and the like.",
      "contextHash": "e97a33632985367ab244d9198132ec108afbd318b2038dd1ae72b1ae4d00131a"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-008",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 戦闘開始時に時間差",
      "sourceHash": "dea716aa371ee8d9be4ee4ced088c89d09eb9642855f70964d44422c3c7acc17",
      "translation": "// Time delay at battle start",
      "contextHash": "dea716aa371ee8d9be4ee4ced088c89d09eb9642855f70964d44422c3c7acc17"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-009",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "// 時間差",
      "sourceHash": "f16a1f40535878c9b68fd77916b2b87deb4ce6aa1889b9e79fda59dddefbc33a",
      "translation": "// Time delay",
      "contextHash": "27660ed5bf287a4d9be08f909f1d9226f042890444ad27e9f4d6358b43b7851c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-010",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "airY = -500 // 空中Ｙ座標",
      "sourceHash": "13d455c57b7cc9c543d256ab811b7262bccd7086768358f4aba6d1235b8f93ca",
      "translation": "airY = -500 // Airborne Y coordinate",
      "contextHash": "13d455c57b7cc9c543d256ab811b7262bccd7086768358f4aba6d1235b8f93ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-011",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ex = a._homeX // 終点Ｘ座標",
      "sourceHash": "e747cf0dc45528854b11206e934881d0de106d6c54271e9ef74b06b60fbc0585",
      "translation": "ex = a._homeX // Ending X coordinate",
      "contextHash": "e747cf0dc45528854b11206e934881d0de106d6c54271e9ef74b06b60fbc0585"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-012",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ey = a._homeY // 終点Ｙ座標",
      "sourceHash": "d8367a3f908a7eaab930b539101c856c6fb8dcf55757ff0e1f329b397d9b759f",
      "translation": "ey = a._homeY // Ending Y coordinate",
      "contextHash": "d8367a3f908a7eaab930b539101c856c6fb8dcf55757ff0e1f329b397d9b759f"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-013",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "frame = 8 // 移動時間",
      "sourceHash": "d9564cf8bdd445b8498c7444dc62242e642b330c90babd50474030376be64fd6",
      "translation": "frame = 8 // Movement time",
      "contextHash": "d9564cf8bdd445b8498c7444dc62242e642b330c90babd50474030376be64fd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-014",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "airY = 0 // 空中Ｙ座標",
      "sourceHash": "ac27a09966c9796d5d42afb77fdad72d56a7a7b4c2d9b9221be04da91a2d983d",
