      "contextHash": "ac27a09966c9796d5d42afb77fdad72d56a7a7b4c2d9b9221be04da91a2d983d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "赤字部分ですが、アクターの場合はなぜか『+1』しておかないと動きません……。",
      "sourceHash": "7c68d7d5bccb8ca2777f95fd841639d91f919db777d9b8e1db6f347bb3643cbc",
      "translation": "Regarding the red portion, for some reason it will not work for actors unless you add 『+1』…….",
      "contextHash": "7c68d7d5bccb8ca2777f95fd841639d91f919db777d9b8e1db6f347bb3643cbc"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "アクターの開始演出（ActorDynamicId）",
      "sourceHash": "11b0dad99c831f126847f3b8d1a90b82a1717cba8b335addd31352c7b9837f7b",
      "translation": "Actor Start Effect (ActorDynamicId)",
      "contextHash": "11b0dad99c831f126847f3b8d1a90b82a1717cba8b335addd31352c7b9837f7b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "アクターの戦闘開始演出（初期値）です。",
      "sourceHash": "d5918719dc2e3da8035ffe9ec1f21d174f0a9884671383b8b93cc896b3fe7b03",
      "translation": "This is the actor's battle start effect (default value).",
      "contextHash": "d5918719dc2e3da8035ffe9ec1f21d174f0a9884671383b8b93cc896b3fe7b03"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "演出を定義したスキルを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0f845fe58ddde52d0ec43a5aaf6f795b476df628d69860dc5b02235f97c3019e",
      "translation": "Specify the skill that defines the effect.",
      "contextHash": "0f845fe58ddde52d0ec43a5aaf6f795b476df628d69860dc5b02235f97c3019e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "敵キャラの開始演出（EnemyDynamicId）",
      "sourceHash": "0981e9e6c160fb3ca4a5d41f899abfb02dff250336b0b8e661e4397453c9f882",
      "translation": "Enemy Start Effect (EnemyDynamicId)",
      "contextHash": "0981e9e6c160fb3ca4a5d41f899abfb02dff250336b0b8e661e4397453c9f882"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵キャラの戦闘開始演出（初期値）です。",
      "sourceHash": "c2883e8182af8e9662147aa3652b0e9b941e5174d2d035f63a0f823ae152d38f",
      "translation": "This is the enemy's battle start effect (default value).",
      "contextHash": "c2883e8182af8e9662147aa3652b0e9b941e5174d2d035f63a0f823ae152d38f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "演出を定義したスキルを指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0f845fe58ddde52d0ec43a5aaf6f795b476df628d69860dc5b02235f97c3019e",
      "translation": "Specify the skill that defines the effect.",
      "contextHash": "0f845fe58ddde52d0ec43a5aaf6f795b476df628d69860dc5b02235f97c3019e"
    }
